          "role": "review",
          "speaker": "clerk",
          "text": "ご使用になる方はどなたですか？",
          "voice": "Puck",
          "speed": "fast",
          "ambience": true,
          "screen": null,
          "audio": "drugstore-checkout.medicine-user.p2.mp3"
        },
        {
          "id": "drugstore-checkout.medicine-user.p3",
          "role": "review",
          "speaker": "clerk",
          "text": "お客様ご自身でお使いですか？",
          "voice": "Kore",
          "speed": "normal",
          "ambience": false,
          "screen": null,
          "audio": "drugstore-checkout.medicine-user.p3.mp3"
        }
      ],
      "choices": [
        {
          "id": "a",
          "text": {
            "zh-Hant": "以前用過這個藥嗎",
            "zh-Hans": "以前用过这个药吗",
            "en": "Have you used this medicine before"
          },
          "correct": false
        },
        {
          "id": "b",
          "text": {
            "zh-Hant": "這個藥要買幾盒",
            "zh-Hans": "这个药要买几盒",
            "en": "How many boxes do you want"
          },
          "correct": false
        },
        {
          "id": "c",
          "text": {
            "zh-Hant": "藥是誰要用",
            "zh-Hans": "药是谁要用",
            "en": "Who will use the medicine"
          },
          "correct": true
        }
      ],
      "response": {
        "ja": "私です／家族が使います",
        "audio": "drugstore-checkout.medicine-user.response.mp3",
        "voice": "Orus"
      },
      "explanation": {
        "zh-Hant": "有些藥結帳時要確認是誰要用，藥劑師可能會接著問幾句。「ご本人様」「ご自身」是你本人，自己用就說「私です」。用藥的事依店家／規定不同，以現場藥劑師說明為準。",
        "zh-Hans": "有些药结账时要确认是谁要用，药剂师可能会接着问几句。「ご本人様」「ご自身」是你本人，自己用就说「私です」。用药的事依店家／规定不同，以现场药剂师说明为准。",
        "en": "For some medicines the store must check who will use them, and a pharmacist may ask a few more questions. ご本人様 and ご自身 mean you yourself, so say 私です if it is for you. Rules differ by store and product, so follow what the pharmacist tells you."
      },
      "wordIds": [
        "over-the-counter-medicine",
        "pharmacy-clerk"
      ],
      "reviewNote": "第1類医薬品・要指導医薬品的確認（誰問、何時問、接著問什麼）要請藥劑師或熟藥事法規的人看過；本句只教聽懂「誰要用」。"
    },
